<h1 id="golisp-tutorial">GoLisp – Tutorial</h1>
<p>Dieses Dokument beschreibt die öffentlichen Funktionen, Spezialformen
und Makros von GoLisp mit kurzen, lauffähigen Beispielen.
Dateioperationen nutzen immer das Projekt-temp-Verzeichnis
<code>./tmp</code>. Funktionen, die externe Dienste benötigen (sigo,
PostgreSQL), enthalten beschreibende Beispiele.</p>
<h2 id="spezialformen">Spezialformen</h2>
<h3 id="quote">quote</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(quote ausdruck)  bzw.  'ausdruck</code></p>
<p>Verhindert die Auswertung eines Ausdrucks und gibt ihn als
Datenstruktur zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb1"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb1-1"><a href="#cb1-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">quote</span> (<span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span>
<span id="cb1-2"><a href="#cb1-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&#39;(<span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span>
<span id="cb1-3"><a href="#cb1-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">car</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="if">if</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(if bedingung dann [sonst])</code></p>
<p>Wertet dann aus, wenn die Bedingung wahr ist, sonst den optionalen
else-Zweig.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb2"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb2-1"><a href="#cb2-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">if</span> <span class="kw">t</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span>
<span id="cb2-2"><a href="#cb2-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">if</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="dt">&#39;ja</span> <span class="dt">&#39;nein</span>)</span>
<span id="cb2-3"><a href="#cb2-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">if</span> (<span class="op">&gt;</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) <span class="dt">&#39;gr</span>ößer)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="define">define</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(define symbol wert)  bzw.  (setq symbol wert)</code></p>
<p>Bindet einen Wert an einen Namen im aktuellen Environment.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb3"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb3-1"><a href="#cb3-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define x <span class="dv">10</span>)</span>
<span id="cb3-2"><a href="#cb3-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">setq</span> y <span class="dv">20</span>)</span>
<span id="cb3-3"><a href="#cb3-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">+</span> x y)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="setq">setq</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(setq symbol wert)</code></p>
<p>Alias für define – bindet einen Wert an einen Namen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb4"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb4-1"><a href="#cb4-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">setq</span> antwort <span class="dv">42</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="defun">defun</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(defun name (parameter ...) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Definiert eine benannte Funktion. Mehrere Body-Ausdrücke werden
implizit in begin gewrappt.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb5"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb5-1"><a href="#cb5-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">defun</span><span class="fu"> quadrat </span>(x) (<span class="op">*</span> x x))</span>
<span id="cb5-2"><a href="#cb5-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(quadrat <span class="dv">7</span>)</span>
<span id="cb5-3"><a href="#cb5-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">defun</span><span class="fu"> add </span>(a b) (<span class="kw">print</span> a) (<span class="op">+</span> a b))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="lambda">lambda</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(lambda (parameter ...) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Erzeugt eine anonyme Funktion bzw. Closure.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb6"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb6-1"><a href="#cb6-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>((<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">*</span> x <span class="dv">2</span>)) <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb6-2"><a href="#cb6-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define doppel (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">*</span> <span class="dv">2</span> x)))</span>
<span id="cb6-3"><a href="#cb6-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(doppel <span class="dv">4</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="let">let</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(let ((var wert) ...) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Bindet Variablen parallel – alle Werte werden im äußeren Environment
ausgewertet.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb7"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb7-1"><a href="#cb7-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">let</span> ((a <span class="dv">1</span>) (b <span class="dv">2</span>)) (<span class="op">+</span> a b))</span>
<span id="cb7-2"><a href="#cb7-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">let</span> ((x <span class="dv">5</span>) (y <span class="dv">10</span>)) (<span class="kw">list</span> x y))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="let-1">let*</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(let* ((var wert) ...) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Bindet Variablen sequentiell – jede Bindung sieht die vorherigen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb8"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb8-1"><a href="#cb8-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">let*</span> ((x <span class="dv">1</span>) (y (<span class="op">+</span> x <span class="dv">1</span>))) y)</span>
<span id="cb8-2"><a href="#cb8-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">let*</span> ((a <span class="dv">2</span>) (b (<span class="op">*</span> a <span class="dv">3</span>))) (<span class="op">+</span> a b))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="begin">begin</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(begin ausdruck ...)</code></p>
<p>Wertet Ausdrücke nacheinander aus und gibt das Ergebnis des letzten
zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb9"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb9-1"><a href="#cb9-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(begin (<span class="kw">print</span> <span class="dv">1</span>) (<span class="kw">print</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb9-2"><a href="#cb9-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(begin (define x <span class="dv">1</span>) (set! x <span class="dv">2</span>) x)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="set">set!</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(set! symbol wert)</code></p>
<p>Ändert den Wert einer bestehenden Variablen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb10"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb10-1"><a href="#cb10-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define a <span class="dv">1</span>)</span>
<span id="cb10-2"><a href="#cb10-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(set! a <span class="dv">99</span>)</span>
<span id="cb10-3"><a href="#cb10-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>a</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="setq-1">setq*</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(setq* var1 wert1 var2 wert2 ...)</code></p>
<p>Setzt mehrere Variablen sequentiell; fehlende Variablen werden neu
angelegt.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb11"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb11-1"><a href="#cb11-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(setq* a <span class="dv">1</span> b (<span class="op">+</span> a <span class="dv">1</span>) c (<span class="op">+</span> b <span class="dv">1</span>))</span>
<span id="cb11-2"><a href="#cb11-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">list</span> a b c)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="defmacro">defmacro</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(defmacro name (parameter ...) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Definiert ein Makro, das zur Expandierungszeit transformiert
wird.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb12"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb12-1"><a href="#cb12-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">defmacro</span><span class="fu"> unless </span>(test . body) `(<span class="kw">if</span> ,test () (begin ,@body)))</span>
<span id="cb12-2"><a href="#cb12-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">unless</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="dt">&#39;ok</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="macroexpand">macroexpand</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(macroexpand form)</code></p>
<p>Expandiert Makros einmal auf Top-Level und gibt das Ergebnis
zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb13"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb13-1"><a href="#cb13-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">defmacro</span><span class="fu"> doppelt </span>(x) `(<span class="op">+</span> ,x ,x))</span>
<span id="cb13-2"><a href="#cb13-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">macroexpand</span> (doppelt <span class="dv">5</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="macroexpand-all">macroexpand-all</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(macroexpand-all form)</code></p>
<p>Expandiert Makros rekursiv in allen Subformen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb14"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb14-1"><a href="#cb14-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(macroexpand-all (doppelt (<span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="function">function</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(function ausdruck)</code></p>
<p>Wertet den übergebenen Ausdruck aus und gibt seinen Wert zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb15"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb15-1"><a href="#cb15-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">function</span> <span class="op">+</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="flet">flet</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(flet ((name (parameter ...) body ...) ...) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Definiert lokale Funktionen, die über das äußere Environment
schließen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb16"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb16-1"><a href="#cb16-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">flet</span> ((inc (x) (<span class="op">+</span> x <span class="dv">1</span>))) (inc <span class="dv">5</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="labels">labels</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(labels ((name (parameter ...) body ...) ...) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Wie flet, aber die lokalen Funktionen können sich gegenseitig
rekursiv aufrufen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb17"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb17-1"><a href="#cb17-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">labels</span> ((fac (n) (<span class="kw">if</span> (<span class="op">=</span> n <span class="dv">0</span>) <span class="dv">1</span> (<span class="op">*</span> n (fac (<span class="op">-</span> n <span class="dv">1</span>)))))) (fac <span class="dv">5</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="block">block</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(block name body ...)</code></p>
<p>Benannter Block; return-from kann ihn vorzeitig verlassen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb18"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb18-1"><a href="#cb18-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">block</span> aus (<span class="kw">return-from</span> aus <span class="dv">42</span>) (<span class="kw">print</span> <span class="dt">&#39;nie</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="return-from">return-from</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(return-from name [wert])</code></p>
<p>Verlässt den benannten Block nicht-lokal und liefert den optionalen
Wert.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb19"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb19-1"><a href="#cb19-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">block</span> outer (<span class="kw">return-from</span> outer <span class="dv">99</span>) <span class="dt">&#39;unten</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="mapcar">mapcar</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(mapcar funktion liste)</code></p>
<p>Wendet eine Funktion auf jedes Element einer Liste an und liefert die
Ergebnisliste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb20"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb20-1"><a href="#cb20-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">mapcar</span> (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">*</span> x x)) &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb20-2"><a href="#cb20-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">mapcar</span> atom? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> (<span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>) <span class="st">&quot;a&quot;</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="load">load</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(load "datei.lisp")</code></p>
<p>Lädt eine Lisp-Datei, wertet alle enthaltenen Ausdrücke aus und gibt
das letzte Ergebnis zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb21"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb21-1"><a href="#cb21-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">load</span> <span class="st">&quot;stdlib.lisp&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="and">and</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(and ausdruck ...)</code></p>
<p>Wertet Ausdrücke von links nach rechts aus und bricht bei nil ab.
Liefert den letzten wahren Wert.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb22"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb22-1"><a href="#cb22-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">and</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-2"><a href="#cb22-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">and</span> <span class="kw">t</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="dt">&#39;x</span>)</span>
<span id="cb22-3"><a href="#cb22-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">and</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="or">or</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(or ausdruck ...)</code></p>
<p>Wertet Ausdrücke von links nach rechts aus und liefert den ersten
wahren Wert, sonst nil.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb23"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb23-1"><a href="#cb23-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">or</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="dt">&#39;a</span> <span class="dt">&#39;b</span>)</span>
<span id="cb23-2"><a href="#cb23-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">or</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span>
<span id="cb23-3"><a href="#cb23-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">or</span> <span class="dv">0</span> <span class="dt">&#39;x</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="not">not</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(not x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x falsch (nil) ist, sonst nil.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb24"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb24-1"><a href="#cb24-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">not</span> <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span>
<span id="cb24-2"><a href="#cb24-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">not</span> <span class="kw">t</span>)</span>
<span id="cb24-3"><a href="#cb24-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">not</span> <span class="dv">0</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="cond">cond</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(cond (test body ...) ... [(else body ...)])</code></p>
<p>Verzweigungskette; der erste wahre Test bestimmt den ausgeführten
Body.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb25"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb25-1"><a href="#cb25-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cond</span> ((<span class="op">=</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) <span class="dt">&#39;nein</span>) (<span class="kw">t</span> <span class="dt">&#39;ja</span>))</span>
<span id="cb25-2"><a href="#cb25-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cond</span> ((<span class="op">&gt;</span> <span class="dv">5</span> <span class="dv">3</span>) <span class="dt">&#39;gr</span>ößer) (else <span class="dt">&#39;kleiner</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="case">case</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(case schlüssel ((wert ...) body ...) ... [(else body ...)])</code></p>
<p>Wählt einen Zweig durch strukturelle Gleichheit (equal?) des
Schlüssels aus.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb26"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb26-1"><a href="#cb26-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">case</span> <span class="dt">&#39;b</span> ((a) <span class="dv">1</span>) ((b c) <span class="dv">2</span>) (else <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb26-2"><a href="#cb26-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">case</span> <span class="dv">5</span> ((<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>) <span class="st">&quot;klein&quot;</span>) ((<span class="dv">4</span> <span class="dv">5</span> <span class="dv">6</span>) <span class="st">&quot;mittel&quot;</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="while">while</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(while test body ...)</code></p>
<p>Wertet den Body so lange aus, wie der Test wahr ist. Gibt nil
zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb27"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb27-1"><a href="#cb27-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define i <span class="dv">0</span>)</span>
<span id="cb27-2"><a href="#cb27-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(while (<span class="op">&lt;</span> i <span class="dv">3</span>) (<span class="kw">print</span> i) (set! i (<span class="op">+</span> i <span class="dv">1</span>)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="do">do</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(do ((var init schritt) ...) (test ergebnis) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Scheme-artige Schleife mit parallelen Bindungen, Abbruchtest und
optionalem Body.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb28"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb28-1"><a href="#cb28-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">do</span> ((i <span class="dv">0</span> (<span class="op">+</span> i <span class="dv">1</span>))) ((<span class="op">=</span> i <span class="dv">3</span>) i) (<span class="kw">print</span> i))</span>
<span id="cb28-2"><a href="#cb28-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">do</span> ((x <span class="dv">1</span> (<span class="op">*</span> x <span class="dv">2</span>)) (n <span class="dv">0</span> (<span class="op">+</span> n <span class="dv">1</span>))) ((<span class="op">&gt;</span> x <span class="dv">10</span>) n))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="quasiquote">quasiquote</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(quasiquote ausdruck)  bzw.</code>ausdruck`</p>
<p>Wie quote, erlaubt aber unquote (,x) und unquote-splice (,<span
class="citation" data-cites="x">@x</span>) innerhalb.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb29"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb29-1"><a href="#cb29-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define x <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb29-2"><a href="#cb29-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>`(liste ,x)</span>
<span id="cb29-3"><a href="#cb29-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>`(a ,@&#39;(b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="eval">eval</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(eval ausdruck)</code></p>
<p>Wertet einen bereits ausgewerteten Ausdruck nochmals im globalen
Environment aus.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb30"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb30-1"><a href="#cb30-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">eval</span> &#39;(<span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span>
<span id="cb30-2"><a href="#cb30-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define code &#39;(<span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>))</span>
<span id="cb30-3"><a href="#cb30-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">eval</span> code)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="catch">catch</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(catch body handler)</code></p>
<p>Fängt Fehler im Body ab und ruft handler mit der Fehler-Cell auf.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb31"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb31-1"><a href="#cb31-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">catch</span> (<span class="kw">error</span> <span class="st">&quot;ups&quot;</span>) (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (e) (<span class="kw">list</span> <span class="dt">&#39;fehler</span> e)))</span>
<span id="cb31-2"><a href="#cb31-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">catch</span> (<span class="op">/</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">0</span>) (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (e) <span class="dt">&#39;recovered</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="parfunc">parfunc</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(parfunc ergebnis [:timeout n] ausdruck ...)</code></p>
<p>Wertet alle Ausdrücke parallel aus, speichert die Ergebnisliste in
ergebnis und gibt sie zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb32"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb32-1"><a href="#cb32-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(parfunc ergebnis (<span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) (<span class="op">*</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>) (<span class="op">-</span> <span class="dv">10</span> <span class="dv">5</span>))</span>
<span id="cb32-2"><a href="#cb32-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">car</span> ergebnis)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="lock">lock</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(lock mutex ausdruck ...)</code></p>
<p>Führt die Ausdrücke atomar unter dem angegebenen Mutex aus.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb33"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb33-1"><a href="#cb33-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define m (lock-make))</span>
<span id="cb33-2"><a href="#cb33-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define x <span class="dv">0</span>)</span>
<span id="cb33-3"><a href="#cb33-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(lock m (set! x (<span class="op">+</span> x <span class="dv">1</span>)) (set! x (<span class="op">+</span> x <span class="dv">1</span>)))</span>
<span id="cb33-4"><a href="#cb33-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>x</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="arithmetik">Arithmetik</h2>
<h3 id="section">+</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(+ zahl ...)</code></p>
<p>Addiert alle übergebenen Zahlen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb34"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb34-1"><a href="#cb34-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb34-2"><a href="#cb34-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">+</span> <span class="fl">5.5</span> <span class="fl">4.5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="section-1">-</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(- zahl ...)  bzw.  (- x y)</code></p>
<p>Subtrahiert die folgenden Zahlen von der ersten. Ohne Argumente
liefert es 0.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb35"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb35-1"><a href="#cb35-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">-</span> <span class="dv">10</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb35-2"><a href="#cb35-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">-</span> <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="section-2">*</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(* zahl ...)</code></p>
<p>Multipliziert alle übergebenen Zahlen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb36"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb36-1"><a href="#cb36-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">*</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>)</span>
<span id="cb36-2"><a href="#cb36-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">*</span> <span class="dv">7</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="section-3">/</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(/ x y)</code></p>
<p>Dividiert x durch y. Fehler bei Division durch 0.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb37"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb37-1"><a href="#cb37-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">/</span> <span class="dv">10</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span>
<span id="cb37-2"><a href="#cb37-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">/</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">4</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="mod">mod</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(mod x y)</code></p>
<p>Liefert den Rest der Division x durch y (Gleitkomma).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb38"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb38-1"><a href="#cb38-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">mod</span> <span class="dv">10</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb38-2"><a href="#cb38-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">mod</span> <span class="fl">7.5</span> <span class="fl">2.5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="remainder">remainder</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(remainder x y)</code></p>
<p>Alias für mod.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb39"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb39-1"><a href="#cb39-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(remainder <span class="dv">10</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="abs">abs</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(abs x)</code></p>
<p>Liefert den absoluten Betrag einer Zahl.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb40"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb40-1"><a href="#cb40-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">abs</span> <span class="op">-</span><span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb40-2"><a href="#cb40-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">abs</span> <span class="op">-</span><span class="fl">3.14</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="random">random</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(random)  bzw.  (random n)</code></p>
<p>Liefert eine Zufallszahl. Ohne Argument eine große ganze Zahl, mit n
einen Wert von 0 bis n-1.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb41"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb41-1"><a href="#cb41-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">random</span> <span class="dv">6</span>)</span>
<span id="cb41-2"><a href="#cb41-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">random</span> <span class="dv">100</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="vergleiche">Vergleiche</h2>
<h3 id="section-4">=</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(= x y)</code></p>
<p>Numerische Gleichheit.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb42"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb42-1"><a href="#cb42-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">=</span> <span class="dv">5</span> <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb42-2"><a href="#cb42-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">=</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="section-5">&lt;</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(&lt; x y)</code></p>
<p>Numerisch kleiner.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb43"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb43-1"><a href="#cb43-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">&lt;</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb43-2"><a href="#cb43-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">&lt;</span> <span class="dv">5</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="section-6">&gt;</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(&gt; x y)</code></p>
<p>Numerisch größer.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb44"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb44-1"><a href="#cb44-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">&gt;</span> <span class="dv">5</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span>
<span id="cb44-2"><a href="#cb44-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">&gt;</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="section-7">&gt;=</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(&gt;= x y)</code></p>
<p>Numerisch größer oder gleich.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb45"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb45-1"><a href="#cb45-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">&gt;=</span> <span class="dv">5</span> <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="section-8">&lt;=</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(&lt;= x y)</code></p>
<p>Numerisch kleiner oder gleich.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb46"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb46-1"><a href="#cb46-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="op">&lt;=</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">7</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="equal">equal?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(equal? x y)</code></p>
<p>Strukturelle Gleichheit (rekursiv für Listen).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb47"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb47-1"><a href="#cb47-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(equal? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span>
<span id="cb47-2"><a href="#cb47-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(equal? <span class="dt">&#39;a</span> <span class="dt">&#39;a</span>)</span>
<span id="cb47-3"><a href="#cb47-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(equal? <span class="dv">5</span> <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="eq">eq</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(eq x y)</code></p>
<p>Pointer-Identität – prüft, ob beide Argumente dasselbe Objekt im
Speicher sind.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb48"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb48-1"><a href="#cb48-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">eq</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span>
<span id="cb48-2"><a href="#cb48-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">eq</span> (<span class="kw">list</span>) (<span class="kw">list</span>))</span>
<span id="cb48-3"><a href="#cb48-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">eq</span> <span class="dt">&#39;foo</span> <span class="dt">&#39;foo</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="eq-1">eq?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(eq? x y)</code></p>
<p>Alias für eq.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb49"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb49-1"><a href="#cb49-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(eq? <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="typ-prädikate">Typ-Prädikate</h2>
<h3 id="string">string?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string? x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x ein String ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb50"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb50-1"><a href="#cb50-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string? <span class="st">&quot;hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb50-2"><a href="#cb50-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string? <span class="dv">42</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="number">number?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(number? x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x eine Zahl ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb51"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb51-1"><a href="#cb51-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(number? <span class="dv">42</span>)</span>
<span id="cb51-2"><a href="#cb51-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(number? <span class="st">&quot;42&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="list">list?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(list? x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x eine Liste oder nil ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb52"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb52-1"><a href="#cb52-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(list? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span>
<span id="cb52-2"><a href="#cb52-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(list? <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span>
<span id="cb52-3"><a href="#cb52-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(list? <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="symbol">symbol?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(symbol? x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x ein Symbol (Atom) ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb53"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb53-1"><a href="#cb53-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(symbol? <span class="dt">&#39;foo</span>)</span>
<span id="cb53-2"><a href="#cb53-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(symbol? <span class="st">&quot;foo&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="atom">atom?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(atom? x)</code></p>
<p>Alias für atom – gibt t zurück, wenn x kein Cons/Liste ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb54"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb54-1"><a href="#cb54-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(atom? <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb54-2"><a href="#cb54-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(atom? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="null">null?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(null? x)</code></p>
<p>Alias für null – gibt t zurück, wenn x nil ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb55"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb55-1"><a href="#cb55-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(null? <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span>
<span id="cb55-2"><a href="#cb55-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(null? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="atom-1">atom</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(atom x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x kein Cons/Liste ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb56"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb56-1"><a href="#cb56-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">atom</span> <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb56-2"><a href="#cb56-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">atom</span> <span class="dt">&#39;x</span>)</span>
<span id="cb56-3"><a href="#cb56-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">atom</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="null-1">null</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(null x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x nil ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb57"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb57-1"><a href="#cb57-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">null</span> <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span>
<span id="cb57-2"><a href="#cb57-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">null</span> &#39;())</span>
<span id="cb57-3"><a href="#cb57-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">null</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="listen">Listen</h2>
<h3 id="car">car</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(car liste)</code></p>
<p>Liefert das erste Element einer Liste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb58"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb58-1"><a href="#cb58-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">car</span> &#39;(a b c))</span>
<span id="cb58-2"><a href="#cb58-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">car</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="cdr">cdr</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(cdr liste)</code></p>
<p>Liefert die Restliste ohne das erste Element.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb59"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb59-1"><a href="#cb59-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cdr</span> &#39;(a b c))</span>
<span id="cb59-2"><a href="#cb59-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cdr</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="cons">cons</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(cons x liste)</code></p>
<p>Fügt x als neues Kopfelement vor eine Liste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb60"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb60-1"><a href="#cb60-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cons</span> <span class="dv">1</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb60-2"><a href="#cb60-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cons</span> <span class="dt">&#39;a</span> <span class="kw">nil</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="list-1">list</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(list element ...)</code></p>
<p>Erzeugt eine neue Liste aus den Argumenten.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb61"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb61-1"><a href="#cb61-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">list</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb61-2"><a href="#cb61-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">list</span> <span class="dt">&#39;a</span> <span class="dt">&#39;b</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="append">append</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(append liste element)</code></p>
<p>Hängt ein einzelnes Element an das Ende einer Liste an.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb62"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb62-1"><a href="#cb62-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">append</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb62-2"><a href="#cb62-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">append</span> &#39;(a) <span class="dt">&#39;b</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="apply">apply</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(apply funktion arg1 ... liste)</code></p>
<p>Wendet eine Funktion an; das letzte Argument wird als Liste
gesplict.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb63"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb63-1"><a href="#cb63-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">apply</span> <span class="op">+</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb63-2"><a href="#cb63-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">apply</span> <span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="funcall">funcall</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(funcall funktion arg ...)</code></p>
<p>Ruft eine Funktion mit den angegebenen Argumenten auf.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb64"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb64-1"><a href="#cb64-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">funcall</span> <span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb64-2"><a href="#cb64-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">funcall</span> (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">*</span> x x)) <span class="dv">6</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="strings">Strings</h2>
<h3 id="string-length">string-length</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-length str)</code></p>
<p>Liefert die Anzahl der Zeichen (Runes) eines Strings.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb65"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb65-1"><a href="#cb65-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-length <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb65-2"><a href="#cb65-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-length <span class="st">&quot;αβγ&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-append">string-append</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-append str ...)</code></p>
<p>Verkettet mehrere Strings zu einem neuen String.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb66"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb66-1"><a href="#cb66-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-append <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot; &quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;Welt&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb66-2"><a href="#cb66-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-append <span class="st">&quot;a&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;b&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;c&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="substring">substring</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(substring str start end)</code></p>
<p>Liefert den Teilstring von start (inklusiv) bis end (exklusiv).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb67"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb67-1"><a href="#cb67-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(substring <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span> <span class="dv">0</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span>
<span id="cb67-2"><a href="#cb67-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(substring <span class="st">&quot;Welt&quot;</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-upcase">string-upcase</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-upcase str)</code></p>
<p>Wandelt einen String in Großbuchstaben um.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb68"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb68-1"><a href="#cb68-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">string-upcase</span> <span class="st">&quot;hallo&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-downcase">string-downcase</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-downcase str)</code></p>
<p>Wandelt einen String in Kleinbuchstaben um.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb69"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb69-1"><a href="#cb69-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">string-downcase</span> <span class="st">&quot;HALLO&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-number">string-&gt;number</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-&gt;number str)</code></p>
<p>Parst einen String als Zahl.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb70"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb70-1"><a href="#cb70-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-&gt;number <span class="st">&quot;42&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb70-2"><a href="#cb70-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-&gt;number <span class="st">&quot;3.14&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="number-string">number-&gt;string</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(number-&gt;string zahl)</code></p>
<p>Wandelt eine Zahl in einen String um.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb71"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb71-1"><a href="#cb71-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(number-&gt;string <span class="dv">42</span>)</span>
<span id="cb71-2"><a href="#cb71-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(number-&gt;string <span class="fl">3.14</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-list">string-&gt;list</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-&gt;list str)</code></p>
<p>Wandelt einen String in eine Liste von Einzelzeichen-Strings um.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb72"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb72-1"><a href="#cb72-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-&gt;list <span class="st">&quot;abc&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="list-string">list-&gt;string</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(list-&gt;string liste)</code></p>
<p>Verkettet eine Liste von Strings zu einem String.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb73"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb73-1"><a href="#cb73-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(list-&gt;string &#39;(<span class="st">&quot;a&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;b&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;c&quot;</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-replace">string-replace</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(string-replace str alt neu)</code></p>
<p>Ersetzt alle Vorkommen von alt durch neu.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb74"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb74-1"><a href="#cb74-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-replace <span class="st">&quot;Hallo Welt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;Welt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;GoLisp&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-trim">string-trim</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-trim str)</code></p>
<p>Entfernt führende und abschließende Leerzeichen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb75"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb75-1"><a href="#cb75-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">string-trim</span> <span class="st">&quot;  hallo  &quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="string-contains">string-contains</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(string-contains str sub)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn sub in str enthalten ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb76"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb76-1"><a href="#cb76-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-contains <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;all&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb76-2"><a href="#cb76-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(string-contains <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;xyz&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="ein-ausgabe">Ein-/Ausgabe</h2>
<h3 id="print">print</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(print wert ...)</code></p>
<p>Gibt Werte ohne abschließenden Zeilenumbruch auf stdout aus.
Rückgabewert ist das letzte Argument.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb77"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb77-1"><a href="#cb77-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">print</span> <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb77-2"><a href="#cb77-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">print</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="st">&quot; &quot;</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="println">println</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(println wert ...)</code></p>
<p>Gibt Werte mit abschließendem Zeilenumbruch auf stdout aus.
Rückgabewert ist das letzte Argument.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb78"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb78-1"><a href="#cb78-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(println <span class="st">&quot;Zeile&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb78-2"><a href="#cb78-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(println <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="read">read</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(read str)</code></p>
<p>Parst einen String und gibt die entsprechende Lisp-Datenstruktur
zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb79"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb79-1"><a href="#cb79-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">read</span> <span class="st">&quot;(+ 1 2)&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb79-2"><a href="#cb79-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">car</span> (<span class="kw">read</span> <span class="st">&quot;(a b c)&quot;</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="fehler">Fehler</h2>
<h3 id="error">error</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(error wert)</code></p>
<p>Signalisiert einen Lisp-Laufzeitfehler, der von catch aufgefangen
werden kann.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb80"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb80-1"><a href="#cb80-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">error</span> <span class="st">&quot;etwas ist schief&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb80-2"><a href="#cb80-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">catch</span> (<span class="kw">error</span> <span class="dt">&#39;x</span>) (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (e) (println e)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="makro-hilfe">Makro-Hilfe</h2>
<h3 id="gensym">gensym</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(gensym)</code></p>
<p>Erzeugt ein eindeutiges Symbol für Makros.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb81"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb81-1"><a href="#cb81-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">gensym</span>)</span>
<span id="cb81-2"><a href="#cb81-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">gensym</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="datei-io">Datei-I/O</h2>
<h3 id="file-write">file-write</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(file-write "pfad" inhalt ...)</code></p>
<p>Schreibt Inhalte in eine Datei (überschreibt).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb82"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb82-1"><a href="#cb82-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;mkdir -p ./tmp&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb82-2"><a href="#cb82-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-write <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb82-3"><a href="#cb82-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-write <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/zahlen.txt&quot;</span> <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="st">&quot; &quot;</span> <span class="dv">2</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="file-append">file-append</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(file-append "pfad" inhalt ...)</code></p>
<p>Hängt Inhalte an eine Datei an.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb83"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb83-1"><a href="#cb83-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;mkdir -p ./tmp&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb83-2"><a href="#cb83-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-write <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb83-3"><a href="#cb83-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-append <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot; Welt&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="file-read">file-read</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(file-read "pfad")</code></p>
<p>Liest den Inhalt einer Datei als String.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb84"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb84-1"><a href="#cb84-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;mkdir -p ./tmp&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb84-2"><a href="#cb84-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-write <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb84-3"><a href="#cb84-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-read <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="file-exists">file-exists?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(file-exists? "pfad")</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn die Datei existiert.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb85"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb85-1"><a href="#cb85-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;mkdir -p ./tmp&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb85-2"><a href="#cb85-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-exists? <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb85-3"><a href="#cb85-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-exists? <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/nichtda.txt&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="file-delete">file-delete</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(file-delete "pfad")</code></p>
<p>Löscht eine Datei. Gibt t zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb86"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb86-1"><a href="#cb86-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;mkdir -p ./tmp&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb86-2"><a href="#cb86-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-write <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;x&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb86-3"><a href="#cb86-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-delete <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="nebenläufigkeit">Nebenläufigkeit</h2>
<h3 id="chan-make">chan-make</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(chan-make)  bzw.  (chan-make n)</code></p>
<p>Erzeugt einen Channel (optional mit Puffergröße n).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb87"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb87-1"><a href="#cb87-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define ch (chan-make))</span>
<span id="cb87-2"><a href="#cb87-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define ch2 (chan-make <span class="dv">10</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="chan-send">chan-send</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(chan-send ch wert)</code></p>
<p>Sendet einen Wert in einen Channel.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb88"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb88-1"><a href="#cb88-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(chan-send ch <span class="dv">42</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="chan-recv">chan-recv</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(chan-recv ch)</code></p>
<p>Empfängt einen Wert aus einem Channel (blockierend, wenn leer).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb89"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb89-1"><a href="#cb89-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(chan-recv ch)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="lock-make">lock-make</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(lock-make)</code></p>
<p>Erzeugt einen Mutex für lock.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb90"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb90-1"><a href="#cb90-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define mu (lock-make))</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="ki">KI</h2>
<h3 id="sigo">sigo</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(sigo prompt [modell] [session-id] [host])</code></p>
<p>Sendet einen Prompt an sigoREST und gibt die Antwort als String
zurück. Default-Modell und Host können via Env-Variablen gesetzt
werden.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb91"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb91-1"><a href="#cb91-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(sigo <span class="st">&quot;Erkläre TCO&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb91-2"><a href="#cb91-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(sigo <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;cl46-s&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="sigo-models">sigo-models</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(sigo-models)</code></p>
<p>Liefert eine Liste der verfügbaren sigoREST-Modelle.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb92"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb92-1"><a href="#cb92-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(sigo-models)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="sigo-host">sigo-host</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(sigo-host "http://...")</code></p>
<p>Setzt oder liest den sigoREST-Host.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb93"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb93-1"><a href="#cb93-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(sigo-host <span class="st">&quot;http://mammouth:9080&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="zeit">Zeit</h2>
<h3 id="sleep">sleep</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(sleep ms)</code></p>
<p>Pausiert für die angegebene Anzahl Millisekunden.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb94"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb94-1"><a href="#cb94-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">sleep</span> <span class="dv">100</span>)</span>
<span id="cb94-2"><a href="#cb94-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">sleep</span> <span class="dv">2000</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="memory">Memory</h2>
<h3 id="memstats">memstats</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(memstats)</code></p>
<p>Liefert Go-Runtime-Memory-Statistiken als Assoziationsliste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb95"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb95-1"><a href="#cb95-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(memstats)</span>
<span id="cb95-2"><a href="#cb95-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">assoc</span> <span class="dt">&#39;heapalloc</span> (memstats))</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="shell-system">Shell &amp; System</h2>
<h3 id="system">system</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(system "shell-kommando")</code></p>
<p>Führt ein Shell-Kommando aus und gibt den Exit-Code zurück (0 =
OK).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb96"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb96-1"><a href="#cb96-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;echo hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb96-2"><a href="#cb96-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;test -f ./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="file-stat">file-stat</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(file-stat "pfad")</code></p>
<p>Liefert eine Assoziationsliste mit size und mtime oder nil, wenn die
Datei nicht existiert.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb97"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb97-1"><a href="#cb97-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">system</span> <span class="st">&quot;mkdir -p ./tmp&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb97-2"><a href="#cb97-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-write <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;Hallo&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb97-3"><a href="#cb97-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(file-stat <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb97-4"><a href="#cb97-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">assoc</span> <span class="dt">&#39;size</span> (file-stat <span class="st">&quot;./tmp/demo.txt&quot;</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="assoc">assoc</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(assoc key alist)</code></p>
<p>Sucht das erste Paar (key . val) in einer Assoziationsliste mittels
equal?.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb98"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb98-1"><a href="#cb98-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">assoc</span> <span class="dt">&#39;b</span> &#39;((a . <span class="dv">1</span>) (b . <span class="dv">2</span>) (c . <span class="dv">3</span>)))</span>
<span id="cb98-2"><a href="#cb98-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">assoc</span> <span class="dt">&#39;x</span> &#39;((a . <span class="dv">1</span>)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="symbol-string">symbol-&gt;string</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(symbol-&gt;string 'symbol)</code></p>
<p>Wandelt ein Symbol in seinen String-Namen um.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb99"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb99-1"><a href="#cb99-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(symbol-&gt;string <span class="dt">&#39;foo</span>)</span>
<span id="cb99-2"><a href="#cb99-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(symbol-&gt;string <span class="dt">&#39;my-var</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="postgresql">PostgreSQL</h2>
<h3 id="pg-connect">pg-connect</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(pg-connect "connection-string")</code></p>
<p>Öffnet eine PostgreSQL-Verbindung. Connection-String z.B. host=…
port=… user=… password=… dbname=…</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb100"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb100-1"><a href="#cb100-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define conn (pg-connect <span class="st">&quot;host=localhost user=golisp dbname=test sslmode=disable&quot;</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="pg-query">pg-query</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(pg-query conn "SELECT ..." param ...)</code></p>
<p>Führt eine SELECT-Abfrage aus und gibt eine Liste von Zeilen
(Assoziationslisten) zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb101"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb101-1"><a href="#cb101-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(pg-query conn <span class="st">&quot;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1&quot;</span> <span class="dv">42</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="pg-exec">pg-exec</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(pg-exec conn "INSERT/UPDATE ..." param ...)</code></p>
<p>Führt eine schreibende Abfrage aus und gibt die Anzahl betroffener
Zeilen zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb102"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb102-1"><a href="#cb102-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(pg-exec conn <span class="st">&quot;INSERT INTO users (name) VALUES ($1)&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="pg-close">pg-close</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(pg-close conn)</code></p>
<p>Schließt eine PostgreSQL-Verbindung.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb103"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb103-1"><a href="#cb103-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(pg-close conn)</span></code></pre></div>
<h2 id="standardbibliothek">Standardbibliothek</h2>
<h3 id="cadr">cadr</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(cadr liste)</code></p>
<p>Kurzform für (car (cdr liste)).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb104"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb104-1"><a href="#cb104-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cadr</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb104-2"><a href="#cb104-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cadr</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="caddr">caddr</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(caddr liste)</code></p>
<p>Kurzform für (car (cdr (cdr liste))).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb105"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb105-1"><a href="#cb105-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">caddr</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb105-2"><a href="#cb105-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">caddr</span> &#39;(a b c d))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="cadddr">cadddr</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(cadddr liste)</code></p>
<p>Kurzform für (car (cdr (cdr (cdr liste)))).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb106"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb106-1"><a href="#cb106-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cadddr</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="cddr">cddr</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(cddr liste)</code></p>
<p>Kurzform für (cdr (cdr liste)).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb107"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb107-1"><a href="#cb107-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cddr</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb107-2"><a href="#cb107-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cddr</span> &#39;(a b c d))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="cdar">cdar</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(cdar liste)</code></p>
<p>Kurzform für (cdr (car liste)).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb108"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb108-1"><a href="#cb108-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">cdar</span> &#39;((a b c)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="caar">caar</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(caar liste)</code></p>
<p>Kurzform für (car (car liste)).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb109"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb109-1"><a href="#cb109-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">caar</span> &#39;((a b)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="first">first</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(first liste)</code></p>
<p>Alias für car.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb110"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb110-1"><a href="#cb110-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">first</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="second">second</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(second liste)</code></p>
<p>Alias für cadr.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb111"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb111-1"><a href="#cb111-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">second</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="third">third</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(third liste)</code></p>
<p>Alias für caddr.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb112"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb112-1"><a href="#cb112-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">third</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="fourth">fourth</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(fourth liste)</code></p>
<p>Alias für cadddr.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb113"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb113-1"><a href="#cb113-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">fourth</span> &#39;(a b c d))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="rest">rest</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(rest liste)</code></p>
<p>Alias für cdr.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb114"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb114-1"><a href="#cb114-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">rest</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="zero">zero?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(zero? n)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn n gleich 0 ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb115"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb115-1"><a href="#cb115-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(zero? <span class="dv">0</span>)</span>
<span id="cb115-2"><a href="#cb115-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(zero? <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="positive">positive?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(positive? n)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn n größer als 0 ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb116"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb116-1"><a href="#cb116-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(positive? <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb116-2"><a href="#cb116-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(positive? <span class="op">-</span><span class="dv">1</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="negative">negative?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(negative? n)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn n kleiner als 0 ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb117"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb117-1"><a href="#cb117-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(negative? <span class="op">-</span><span class="dv">3</span>)</span>
<span id="cb117-2"><a href="#cb117-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(negative? <span class="dv">1</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="pair">pair?</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(pair? x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn x ein Cons / keine Atom ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb118"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb118-1"><a href="#cb118-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(pair? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span>
<span id="cb118-2"><a href="#cb118-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(pair? <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="when">when</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(when test body ...)</code></p>
<p>Makro: wertet body nur aus, wenn test wahr ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb119"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb119-1"><a href="#cb119-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">when</span> <span class="kw">t</span> <span class="dt">&#39;ja</span>)</span>
<span id="cb119-2"><a href="#cb119-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">when</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="dt">&#39;nein</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="unless">unless</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(unless test body ...)</code></p>
<p>Makro: wertet body nur aus, wenn test falsch ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb120"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb120-1"><a href="#cb120-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">unless</span> <span class="kw">nil</span> <span class="dt">&#39;ja</span>)</span>
<span id="cb120-2"><a href="#cb120-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">unless</span> <span class="kw">t</span> <span class="dt">&#39;nein</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="append-1">append</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(append lst1 lst2)</code></p>
<p>Hängt zwei Listen aneinander.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb121"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb121-1"><a href="#cb121-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">append</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) &#39;(<span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>))</span>
<span id="cb121-2"><a href="#cb121-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">append</span> &#39;(a) &#39;(b c d))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="reverse">reverse</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(reverse liste)</code></p>
<p>Dreht eine Liste um.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb122"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb122-1"><a href="#cb122-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">reverse</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb122-2"><a href="#cb122-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">reverse</span> &#39;(a b c d))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="length">length</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(length liste)</code></p>
<p>Liefert die Anzahl der Elemente einer Liste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb123"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb123-1"><a href="#cb123-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">length</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb123-2"><a href="#cb123-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">length</span> &#39;())</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="nth">nth</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(nth n liste)</code></p>
<p>Liefert das n-te Element einer Liste (0-basiert).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb124"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb124-1"><a href="#cb124-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">nth</span> <span class="dv">0</span> &#39;(a b c))</span>
<span id="cb124-2"><a href="#cb124-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">nth</span> <span class="dv">2</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="last">last</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(last liste)</code></p>
<p>Liefert das letzte Element einer Liste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb125"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb125-1"><a href="#cb125-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">last</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb125-2"><a href="#cb125-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">last</span> &#39;(a b))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="member">member</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(member x liste)</code></p>
<p>Sucht x in einer Liste und gibt die Restliste ab dem Treffer
zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb126"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb126-1"><a href="#cb126-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">member</span> <span class="dt">&#39;b</span> &#39;(a b c))</span>
<span id="cb126-2"><a href="#cb126-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">member</span> <span class="dt">&#39;x</span> &#39;(a b c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="assoc-1">assoc</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(assoc key liste)</code></p>
<p>Sucht key in einer Assoziationsliste und gibt das erste passende (key
val)-Paar zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb127"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb127-1"><a href="#cb127-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">assoc</span> <span class="dt">&#39;b</span> &#39;((a <span class="dv">1</span>) (b <span class="dv">2</span>) (c <span class="dv">3</span>)))</span>
<span id="cb127-2"><a href="#cb127-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">assoc</span> <span class="dt">&#39;x</span> &#39;((a <span class="dv">1</span>)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="filter">filter</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(filter pred liste)</code></p>
<p>Liefert alle Elemente, für die die Prädikatfunktion wahr ist.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb128"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb128-1"><a href="#cb128-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(filter (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">&gt;</span> x <span class="dv">2</span>)) &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>))</span>
<span id="cb128-2"><a href="#cb128-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(filter atom? &#39;((<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) a (<span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>) b))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="reduce">reduce</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(reduce f init liste)</code></p>
<p>Faltet eine Liste mit einer Funktion und einem Startwert
zusammen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb129"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb129-1"><a href="#cb129-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">reduce</span> <span class="op">+</span> <span class="dv">0</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>))</span>
<span id="cb129-2"><a href="#cb129-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">reduce</span> <span class="op">*</span> <span class="dv">1</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">4</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="for-each">for-each</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(for-each f liste)</code></p>
<p>Wendet f auf jedes Element an, gibt nil zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb130"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb130-1"><a href="#cb130-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(for-each println &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb130-2"><a href="#cb130-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(for-each (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="kw">print</span> (<span class="op">*</span> x x))) &#39;(<span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="any">any</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(any pred liste)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn mindestens ein Element die Prädikatfunktion
erfüllt.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb131"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb131-1"><a href="#cb131-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(any (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">&gt;</span> x <span class="dv">5</span>)) &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">6</span>))</span>
<span id="cb131-2"><a href="#cb131-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(any (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">&gt;</span> x <span class="dv">5</span>)) &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="every">every</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(every pred liste)</code></p>
<p>Gibt t zurück, wenn alle Elemente die Prädikatfunktion erfüllen.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb132"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb132-1"><a href="#cb132-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">every</span> number? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb132-2"><a href="#cb132-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">every</span> number? &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> a <span class="dv">3</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="flatten">flatten</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(flatten liste)</code></p>
<p>Entfernt eine Ebene von Verschachtelungen; rekursiv flach.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb133"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb133-1"><a href="#cb133-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(flatten &#39;((<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) (<span class="dv">3</span> (<span class="dv">4</span>))))</span>
<span id="cb133-2"><a href="#cb133-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(flatten &#39;(a (b c) d))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="zip">zip</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(zip lst1 lst2)</code></p>
<p>Verbindet zwei Listen elementweise zu Paaren.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb134"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb134-1"><a href="#cb134-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(zip &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>) &#39;(a b))</span>
<span id="cb134-2"><a href="#cb134-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(zip &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>) &#39;(a b))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="list-tail">list-tail</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(list-tail liste n)</code></p>
<p>Liefert den n-ten Rest der Liste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb135"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb135-1"><a href="#cb135-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(list-tail &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>) <span class="dv">0</span>)</span>
<span id="cb135-2"><a href="#cb135-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(list-tail &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>) <span class="dv">2</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="iota">iota</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(iota n)</code></p>
<p>Erzeugt die Liste (0 1 … n-1).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb136"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb136-1"><a href="#cb136-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(iota <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb136-2"><a href="#cb136-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(iota <span class="dv">0</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="square">square</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(square x)</code></p>
<p>Quadriert x.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb137"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb137-1"><a href="#cb137-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(square <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb137-2"><a href="#cb137-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(square <span class="dv">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="expt">expt</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(expt base exp)</code></p>
<p>Berechnet base hoch exp (exp ganze Zahl, rekursiv).</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb138"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb138-1"><a href="#cb138-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">expt</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">10</span>)</span>
<span id="cb138-2"><a href="#cb138-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">expt</span> <span class="dv">3</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="gcd">gcd</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(gcd a b)</code></p>
<p>Berechnet den größten gemeinsamen Teiler.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb139"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb139-1"><a href="#cb139-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">gcd</span> <span class="dv">48</span> <span class="dv">18</span>)</span>
<span id="cb139-2"><a href="#cb139-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">gcd</span> <span class="dv">100</span> <span class="dv">35</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="dotimes">dotimes</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(dotimes (var n) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Makro: wiederholt body für var von 0 bis n-1.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb140"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb140-1"><a href="#cb140-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">dotimes</span> (i <span class="dv">3</span>) (<span class="kw">print</span> i))</span>
<span id="cb140-2"><a href="#cb140-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">dotimes</span> (i <span class="dv">3</span>) (println (<span class="op">*</span> i i)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="dolist">dolist</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong>
<code>(dolist (var liste) body ...)</code></p>
<p>Makro: iteriert über eine Liste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb141"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb141-1"><a href="#cb141-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">dolist</span> (x &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)) (<span class="kw">print</span> x))</span>
<span id="cb141-2"><a href="#cb141-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">dolist</span> (c &#39;(<span class="st">&quot;a&quot;</span> <span class="st">&quot;b&quot;</span>)) (println c))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="push">push</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(push wert var)</code></p>
<p>Makro: fügt wert am Anfang der Liste in var ein.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb142"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb142-1"><a href="#cb142-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define s &#39;())</span>
<span id="cb142-2"><a href="#cb142-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">push</span> <span class="dv">1</span> s)</span>
<span id="cb142-3"><a href="#cb142-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">push</span> <span class="dv">2</span> s)</span>
<span id="cb142-4"><a href="#cb142-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>s</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="pop">pop</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(pop var)</code></p>
<p>Makro: entfernt und liefert das erste Element der Liste in var.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb143"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb143-1"><a href="#cb143-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(define s &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span>
<span id="cb143-2"><a href="#cb143-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">pop</span> s)</span>
<span id="cb143-3"><a href="#cb143-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>s</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="alist-set">alist-set</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(alist-set key val liste)</code></p>
<p>Setzt oder ersetzt einen Eintrag in einer Assoziationsliste.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb144"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb144-1"><a href="#cb144-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(alist-set <span class="dt">&#39;b</span> <span class="dv">99</span> &#39;((a <span class="dv">1</span>) (b <span class="dv">2</span>)))</span>
<span id="cb144-2"><a href="#cb144-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(alist-set <span class="dt">&#39;d</span> <span class="dv">4</span> &#39;((a <span class="dv">1</span>)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="alist-get">alist-get</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(alist-get key liste)</code></p>
<p>Liefert den Wert zu key aus einer Assoziationsliste oder nil.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb145"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb145-1"><a href="#cb145-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(alist-get <span class="dt">&#39;b</span> &#39;((a <span class="dv">1</span>) (b <span class="dv">2</span>)))</span>
<span id="cb145-2"><a href="#cb145-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(alist-get <span class="dt">&#39;x</span> &#39;((a <span class="dv">1</span>)))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="identity">identity</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(identity x)</code></p>
<p>Gibt x unverändert zurück.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb146"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb146-1"><a href="#cb146-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">identity</span> <span class="dv">42</span>)</span>
<span id="cb146-2"><a href="#cb146-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>(<span class="kw">identity</span> &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>))</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="constantly">constantly</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(constantly x)</code></p>
<p>Liefert eine Funktion, die bei jedem Aufruf x zurückgibt.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb147"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb147-1"><a href="#cb147-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>((<span class="kw">constantly</span> <span class="dv">5</span>) <span class="dt">&#39;a</span> <span class="dt">&#39;b</span>)</span>
<span id="cb147-2"><a href="#cb147-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>((<span class="kw">constantly</span> <span class="dt">&#39;ok</span>) <span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span> <span class="dv">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="complement">complement</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(complement f)</code></p>
<p>Liefert das logische Komplement einer Funktion.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb148"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb148-1"><a href="#cb148-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>((<span class="kw">complement</span> null?) &#39;(<span class="dv">1</span> <span class="dv">2</span>))</span>
<span id="cb148-2"><a href="#cb148-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>((<span class="kw">complement</span> zero?) <span class="dv">5</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="compose">compose</h3>
<p><strong>Syntax:</strong> <code>(compose f g)</code></p>
<p>Liefert eine Funktion, die f(g(x)) auf ein Argument anwendet.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb149"><pre
class="sourceCode lisp"><code class="sourceCode commonlisp"><span id="cb149-1"><a href="#cb149-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>((compose number-&gt;string (<span class="kw">lambda</span> (x) (<span class="op">*</span> x <span class="dv">2</span>))) <span class="dv">5</span>)</span>
<span id="cb149-2"><a href="#cb149-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>((compose <span class="kw">string-upcase</span> symbol-&gt;string) <span class="dt">&#39;foo</span>)</span></code></pre></div>
